000;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-size: 22px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n        }\n        .section-title-container {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        .section-title {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #c5e0b4;\n            padding: 10px 25px;\n            font-size: 22px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            box-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n        }\n        .main-point {\n            background-color: #c5e0b4;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 8px 15px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            box-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n        }\n        .sub-points {\n            padding-left: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n        }\n        .sub-point {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 2;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        .footer {\n            text-align: right;\n            color: #556b2f;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-top: 50px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <div class=\"book-cover placeholder\">\n                [Book Cover Image:<br>乡土中国]\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"title-area\">\n                <h1 class=\"main-title\">《乡土中国》</h1>\n                <h2 class=\"chapter-title\">第一章 乡土本色</h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"meta-info\">\n                <div>作者||费孝通</div>\n                <div>制图by 够未</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"quote\">\n            从基层上看去，中国社会是乡土性的。\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-title\">一、乡下人离不了泥土</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"content-list\">\n            <div class=\"main-point\">1.种地是最靠谱的谋生办法。</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-points\">\n                <div class=\"sub-point\">(1) 三条大河的流域已经全是农业区。</div>\n                <div class=\"sub-point\">(2) 迁移到四周边地上去的子弟，也都是很忠实地守着这直接向土里去讨生活的传统。</div>\n                <div class=\"sub-point\">(3) 美国朋友发问：你们中原去的人，到了这最适宜于放牧的草原上，依旧锄地播种，一家家划着小小的一方地，种植起来；真像是向土里一钻，看不到其他利用这片地的方法了。</div>\n                <div class=\"sub-point\">(4) 老师史禄国先生告诉我：远在西伯利亚，中国人住下了，不管天气如何，还是要下些种子，试试看能不能种地。</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"main-point\">2.靠种地谋生的人才明白泥土的可贵，“土”是他们的命根。</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-points\">\n                <div class=\"sub-point\">(1) “土地”这位最近于人性的神，象征着可贵的泥土。</div>\n                <div class=\"sub-point\">(2) 我初次出国时，奶妈偷偷把一包用红纸裹着的泥土塞在我箱子底下。</div>\n                <div class=\"sub-point\">(3) 电影里看到东欧农业国家的波兰也有着类似的风俗。</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"main-point\">3.农业是直接取资于土地上的。</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-points\">\n                <div class=\"sub-point\">与游牧业和工业相比：种地的人搬不动地，土里的庄稼行动不得。（对比论证）</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            @够未\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
